# platform-bom has no Dockerfile of its own -- it's a shared parent POM, not a
# deployable service, and never produces its own image. This exists for consistency
# with every other AdPilot repo and in case that ever changes. Services consume this
# repository's artifacts from the GitHub Packages Maven registry (see README.md), never
# from its source tree, so no service image build ever reads this directory.

.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.idea
.vscode

# Build output -- built fresh from source inside the image, never copied in
**/target/
**/*.log
**/.flattened-pom.xml

# Documentation -- not a build input
docs/
*.md
